stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NEW: new <burst>
    NEW --> READY: Scheduler::add_process()
    
    READY --> RUNNING: dispatch()
    
    RUNNING --> READY: Preemption<br/>(Quantum agotado)
    RUNNING --> WAITING: I/O Request<br/>Sync Wait
    RUNNING --> TERMINATED: burst_time == 0
    
    WAITING --> READY: I/O Complete<br/>Resource Ready
    
    TERMINATED --> [*]
    
    note right of RUNNING
        Ejemplo Demo:
        T=0: P1,P2,P3 → READY
        T=1: P1 → RUNNING
        T=3: P1 → READY (Q=2)
        T=5: P2 → READY (Q=2)
        T=13: P3 → TERMINATED
    end note
    
    note right of READY
        Cola READY (T=23):
        - PID 4 (Burst=20)
        - PID 5 (Burst=30)
        - PID 6 (Burst=40)
    end note